  "description": "LAJQIX crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C48 H120 B16 Cl2 Nd4 O5 Si8. From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 2 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 2 O neighbors; Nd1F (Nd) has 2 O neighbors; Nd2F (Nd) has 2 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.825-3.979 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 107.38-114.30°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C48H120B16Cl2Nd4O5Si8.",
